# charly build artifacts — never committed
.build/
.check/

# `.containerignore` / `.dockerignore` are NOT ignored here, deliberately: `charly box generate`
# emits them at the project root (source: `defaults.context_ignore`), they are byte-identical to
# the pair opencharly/pod-cdi commits, and a committed copy is what makes this repo's build
# context readable without running the generator. They are generated files — regenerate them,
# never hand-edit them.
